  <para style="h">1 BaThesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul's First Letter to the THESSALONIANS</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 BaThesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 BaTh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwekutanga gwaPhawuli ekwalila</para>
  <para style="mt1">BATHESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo Gwekutanga gwakakwaligwa BaThesalonika</char> gwakakwagwa ndiMpositoli Phawuli (1 BaThesalonika 1.1). Gungaba lukwalo gwekutanga gwakasiwa muBhayibhili gwakakwagwa naPhawuli, gwakakwagwa mumakole angaba makumi mahanu nelin'ompela hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu. Phawuli waka eli kuKhorinte nelubaka ekwala lukwalo igogu egukwalila gubungano lebagalimoyo likuThesalonika, gubungano laakabamba mugwendo gugwe gwebubili gwesumikila (Mihingo 17.1-10). Mulukwalo gweMihingo koyi mugubungano ileli kwaka kuna maGiriki manjinji nemaJuta bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Phawuli</char> azotubula gala muThesalonika kwelubaka gulefu hule kwekuti abamba gubungano ileli, ndizo akatumila lukwalo kudze akuludzile bagalimoyo. Mulukwalo igogu unoleba nekwezwinhu zwihomanana, kakale guna milayo minjinji nekwezila MaKhirisitu aakafanila tjila nayo. Phawuli unotshitshinhila nekwehha kwebubili kwaKhirisitu. Pamwe bagalimoyo begubungano lekuThesalonika baka beyemula ziba kwazo nekwendebo iyeyi. Phawuli wakahingisa ndebo yehha kwaKhirisitu kwebubili kuludzila bagalimoyo kuti batjile nezila inohanhisa Ndzimu (1 BaThesalonika 5.6-8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unotanga nebuyisa gubungano lebagalimoyo neboka Ndzimu nekwalo (1).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotjenesa nekwezwiyeto zwizwe kose nendebo yakahhisiwa naThimothi (2-3).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unoyendilambeli epa milayo kuti MaKhirisitu akafanila tjila tjini akalindila hha kwebubili kwaKhirisitu (1 BaThesalonika 4.1-5; 15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unofidza nebuyisa gubungano kakale, ebakumbila kuti babe nelebeswa kuti umwe newumwe umugubungano unobala lukwalo igogu (1 BaThesalonika 5.16-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 1:1">2 BaTh 1.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:19">2 BaKho 1.19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Mih 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1">17.1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:7">BaR 1.7</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kubva kuna Phawuli <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ndiyezwe Sayilasi</char></note>naSilivenasi naThimothi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kugubungano lebagalimoyo likuThesalonika, laNdzimu Tate naHe Yesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ngoni nekunyalala ngakube kumuli.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Butjilo Nebugalimoyo gweBaThesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 1:3">2 BaTh 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:13">2.13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:9">BaR 1.9</ref>.</char>
    </note>Togala timubokela moseni kuNdzimu, tomusa tjoselele mumitembezelo yedu, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />tikumbula yeta kwenyu kunobva mugalamoyo nehinga kwenyu kweludo nesimidzila kwenyu kunobva mukugalabgwe munaHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu, mbeli kwaTate Ndzimu wedu. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Toziba, makamu anodiwa neNdzimu, kuti watjimuhala; <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />ngobe ndebo mbuya yedu ayizoswika kumuli ngematama koga, koga yakaswika ngemasimba nange Meya yakaYengemala nebvuma kwakapelela. Moziba sekwatakatjila pakati kwenyu, tiyetila imwi. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:2">BaK 2.2</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:10">1 BaTh 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 BaKho 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11.1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5-10">Mih 17.5-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:52">13.52</ref>.</char></note>Makatodza iswi naHe, ngobe makawamutjila dama muli mukumanikana kukulu, koga muna kuhanha kunobva muMeya yakaYengemala, <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />kuyetila kuti mube tjilayidzo kubagalimoyo bose bekuMakhedoniya nebeku Akhayiya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ngobe dama laHe lakawhakala kubva kumuli kusi muMakhedoniya nemu Akhayiya koga, galamoyo kwenyu muNdzimu kweezibgwa mumitunhu yose, kwekuti akutjahakika kuti kube netjatinoleba. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ngobe ibo tjekwabo banoleba kuti makatiwamutjila tjini patakamukumba, nekuti makahandukila tjini kuNdzimu musiyana nemidzimwana, kuti muhingile Ndzimu mpenyu kakale welebeswa, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />nelindila Nkololo uwe unowhobva kudzimu, waakamusa kubafi, Yesu unotiwangulila mubuhongola gunohha.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">N'hingo waPhawuli muThesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Imwi tjekwenyu, makamu edu, moziba kuti mukumba kwedu akuzoba suli; <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Mih 16.19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:1">BaR 1.1</ref>.</char></note>nekene takatabhakhwa zwakayipa kakale tatukwa kuFiliphi, seziba kwenyu, takaba netjilopa muNdzimu wedu kuti timubudze ndebo mbuya yeNdzimu nekene kwaka kuna kunyanyayidziwa kukulu. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Tjikumbilo tjedu atjitobva muyemula kusakatambunuka kene kwehambgwa, kene yedza mutjebela; <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />koga sekwatakabvumiwa neNdzimu kuti tigagwebgwe sumikila ndebo mbuya, ndizo tolebeleka, tisingahanhise banhu, koga tihanhisa Ndzimu iye unoholesesa mimoyo yedu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Moziba kuti atizotongohingisa matama anozipilila kene matama anosumbika pupa, Ndzimu unsupi wedu. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Takatisingahake gudzo linobva kubanhu, kene kumuli kene kubamwe, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />nenguba tingaba takamulemesela nezwatakahaka kumuli sebapositoli baKhirisitu. Koga takaba banyolonyolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzimwe whalo whulukugwi dzoti, “Koga takanga sengawana kumuli”</char></note> kumuli, samme belela bana babo. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ndizo ke, ngobe timuda, takatazwipila mukobela kusi ndebo mbuya yeNdzimu yoga, koga kose nebutjilo gwedu, ngobe timuda kwazo. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ngobe mokumbula hinga nepawuka kwedu, makamu, takahinga siku nesikati, kuyetila kuti tisibe ntolo kuna kene yani wenyu nelubaka tisumikila ndebo mbuya yeNdzimu kumuli.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Mubasupi, neNdzimu unsupi bo, kuti takabe takayengemala kakale takalulama tjini kakale tisingawanike nlandu kumuli imwi bagalimoyo. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Kana moziba kuti umwe newumwe wenyu takawumbhata nezila tate yabanobhata bana babo, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />takamukumbila tikamukulumbidza, kakale tikamutetedza kuti mutjile butjilo gwakafanila Ndzimu, iye unomudanila mubumambo gugwe nemugudzo lile.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Toboka Ndzimu tjoselele, ngobe pamakawamutjila dama leNdzimu lamakawha naswi, amuzoliwamutjila sedama linobva mubanhu, koga makaliwamutjila sekwalili iko ntja, dama leNdzimu, linohinga mumuli imwi bagalimoyo. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Mih 17.5</ref>.</char></note>Kana imwi makamu, makatodza makubungano ebagalimoyo beNdzimu muna Khirisitu Yesu, amuJudiya; ngobe makadziyidziwa nebanhu behango yenyu, sayibo bo bakadziyidziwa nemaJuta, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />akabulaya He Yesu kose nebalebesambeli, naswi bo akatidziyidza kwazo. Ndzimu atohanha nekwawo kakale anonyanyayidza banhu bose <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />ngetidzibisa lebeleka neBataya kuyetila kuti batjidziwe. Ngethama ikoku banohhadza tjilizanyo tjematjinyo abo abanogala bethama. Buhongola gweNdzimu gwatjidzina gukabahhila.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phawuli Unoyemula Bakumba Kakale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Koga, makamu angu, saku takapalalana namwi kwelubaka gufutshwanana, munyama kusi munkumbulo, taka timuhuba kwazo tikagwisa tjose kuti timubone, <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />ngobe taka tihaka hha kumuli, imi Phawuli, ndakayedza kanjinji, koga Satane akatidzibila. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Mulebeswa lose, ini galabgwe kwedu kene hanha kwedu kene tjiyala tjedu tjezwikudza mbeli kwaHe wedu Yesu pakubuya kukwe? Akuta imwi? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Lebeswa, imwi ndimwi gudzo ledu nehanha kwedu!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:15">Mih 17.15</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ndizo takati tisingatjatubule simidzila, tikabona kuli kuhine kuti tisale mu Athenisi tili toga, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />takatuma Thimothi, nghalimoyo saswi kakale eli n'hingi weNdzimu musumikila ndebo mbuya yaKhirisitu, kuti amusimise kakale amukuludzile mubugalimoyo gwenyu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kuyetila kuti kusibe newunozunguziwa nezwiliko izwezwi. Imwi tjekwenyu moziba kuti zwakatilindila. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ngobe patakatilitoseni, takamubudza kuti towhowigwa nebulemo; sekwakwakayetikala wali, seziba kwenyu. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ngentha yayikoku, ndakati ndisingatjatubule whilidzila, ndikatumila Thimothi kuyetila ziba nekwebugalimoyo gwenyu, ndihlila kuti pamwe swiyo nliki watjimulika, n'hingo wedu unoba watjiba suli.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:5">Mih 18.5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Koga ke saku Thimothi atjiswika kutili ebva kumuli, watibudza ndebo dzakanaka dzebugalimoyo neludo gwenyu kakale watizibisa kuti mogala mutikumbula muyemula tibona, saswi bo tiyemula mubona. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ndizo ke makamu, mubuyendasi nemukudziyidzika kwedu kose takakuludzigwa namwi ngentha yebugalimoyo gwenyu; <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />ngobe ngwenu tozwiwha tilibapenyu, saku mulimile makasima munaHe. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ndekwakatini wali boka kwatingapa Ndzimu ngentha yenyu, tibokela kuhanha kose kwatili iko mbeli kweNdzimu wedu ngentha yenyu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Totembezela siku nesikati tikumbila kuti tibonane kumeho namwi kakale timupe zwinotayila mubugalimoyo gwenyu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Ndzimu wedu ibo Tate tjekwabo, naHe wedu Yesu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Ndzimu wedu ibo Tate tjekwabo, naHe wedu Yesu </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:30">Joh 10.30</ref>.</char></note>, ngaatjitihhulila zila yekuti tihhe kumuli. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Kakale He ngabate kuti ludo gwenyu gukule kakale guwande kuwumwe newumwe nekubanhu bose, sezila yatinomuda nayo, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />kuyetila kuti asimise mimoyo yenyu kudze ibe mimoyo isina nlandu kakale yakayengemala mbeli kweNdzimu Tate bedu, pakubuya kwaHe wedu Yesu nebayengemali babe bose.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Butjilo Gunohanhisa Ndzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Tjebupelo makamu, sekwatakamudiya kuti makafanila tjila tjini nehanhisa Ndzimu tjini, sekwamunokuthama, tomukumbila kakale tomukuludzila muzina laHe Yesu kuti mukuwaze. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ngobe moziba milayo yatakamupa muzina laHe Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:18">1 BaKho 6.18</ref>.</char></note>Ngobe ikoku ndiko kuda kweNdzimu, yengemadziwa kwenyu. kuti musithame bupombgwe; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:2">1 BaKho 7.2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pheth 3.7</ref>.</char></note>kudze umwe newumwe wenyu atjile newaakatolana naye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">atjile newaakatolana naye </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kungabva kuti alawule mbili uwe</char></note> nezila yakayengemala kakale inolemekedzeka, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />kusi ngenjemulo mbi dzetjiba, sebataya basingazibe Ndzimu; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />ngakusibe newunotjinyila kene tjebela gamu lile, muna tjakalingisana nendebo iyeyi, ngobe He unowholanga wose nhu unoyeta matjinyo akajali, sekwatakamubudza kale tikamutjemela. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ngobe Ndzimu azotidanila kuhambgwa, koga kubuyengemali. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ndizo kene yani unolamba matama ihawa, haatolamba nhu koga unolamba Ndzimu, iye unomupa Meya iye Yakayengemala.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Akutohakika kuti kube newunomukwalila nekweda makamu, ngobe imwi tjekwenyu makadiyiwa ngeNdzimu kuti mudanane; <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />ilebeswa moda bagalimoyo bose muntunhu wose weMakhedoniya. Koga ke tomukulumbidza, makamu, kuti mukuwaze, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:28">BaE 4.28</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:10-12">2 BaTh 3.10-12</ref>.</char></note> muzwipile tjila butjilo gwakanyalala, mulingisane nezwenyu koga, kakale muhinge nemaboko enyu, sekwatakamulaya, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />kuyetila kuti zila yamunotjila iyete bakuhhe babe nemazwibhato kumuli, kakale musibe ntolo kuwumwe nhu.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buya kwaHe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Atitoyemula kuti musizibe, makamu, ngekwayibabo bakatjiyizela, kuyetila kuti musibe nebuyendasi sayibabo basina kugalabgwe. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:14">2 BaKho 4.14</ref>.</char></note>Ngobe togalamoyo kuti Yesu wakafa akamuka kakale, ndizo ke togalamoyo kuti Ndzimu unowhobahhisa naYesu ibabo bakatjiyizela begalamoyo muwunli.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.15-17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:51">1 BaKho 15.51</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 15:52">52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sediya kwaHe, tomubudza kuti iswi bapenyu, basala kudzina He ehha, atitowhobatangela ibabo bakatjiyizela. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ngobe He tjekukwe unowhodeluka ebva kudzimu nedanilila kunamasimba, newhi lentumwa nkulu wekudzimu, nensindo welunyanga weNdzimu. Bakafa begalamoyo kuna Khirisitu banowhomuka kutanga; <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />kukotjiti iswi bapenyu, basala, towhowhapuligwa pehhugwi tikahangana nabo mumakole tihanganidza He mumeya, ndizo towhoba naHe tjoselele. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Ndizo simisanani nematama ihawa.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Lulamilani Hha kwaHe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:7">Mih 1.7</ref>.</char>
    </note>Koga ngekwelubaka nezwibaka, makamu, akuneni kuti mukwaligwe nekwako. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24.43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2 Pheth 3.10</ref>.</char></note>Ngobe imwi tjekwenyu moziba ntja kuti hhuba laHe lowhoswika sembava busiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:9">2 BaTh 1.9</ref>.</char></note>Hapa banhu betjati, “Kuna kunyalala nedzibilika,” tjinyolotjo kolomoka kowhobaswikila, segwadza kunohhila wetjikadzi weetshibama kakale akuna kwabanowhotihhila. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Koga imwi makamu amuta muhhalima, ilelo hhuba alingadze likamukaabadza sembava. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ngobe moseni mubana betjedza, bana bemasikati; atita bebusiku kene behhalima. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ndizo ke iswi ngatisibhakhwe newhope, sekunota bamwe, koga ngatimuseni meho tibe nekuzwibhata. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ngobe banoyizela banoyizela busiku, nebanolaladza banolaladza busiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59.17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">BaE 6.13-17</ref>.</char></note>Koga saku tili bemasikati, atibeni nekuzwibhata, timbale bugalimoyo neludo kuli tjidzibili tjepafuba, negalabgwe kwetjidziwa kuli whuntshi yetjidzibili tjen'holo. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ngobe Ndzimu azotihalila kuti tiwigwe nebuhongola, koga wakatihala kuti tiwamutjile tjidziwa muzina laHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />iye wakatifila kuyetila kuti kene titjila kene takafa tigale naye. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ndizo ke, kulumbidzanani kakale mubakane, sekwamunothama.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laya Nebuyisa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Tomukumbila, makamu, kuti mulemekedze ibabo banohinga zwakalema pakati kwenyu kakale bali ibo banomutungamila kakale bemulaya muzina laHe, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />mubakudze kwazo neludo ngentha yen'hingo wabo. Ngakube nekunyalala pakati kwenyu.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Kakale tomukulumbidza, makamu, kuti mutjemele basingahake hinga banodzungayila, musimise basina tjilopa, mubhatshe banyolonyolo, mube nemoyonlefu kubanhu bose. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Mube nelebeswa kuti akuna unobgwilizila tjibi netjibi, koga muzwipile gala muyetilana tjakanaka umwe kuwumwe, nekubanhu bose.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Hanhani gose lubaka, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />tembezelani tjoselele, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />bokani mutjimwe netjimwe tjimo; ngobe ikoku ndiko kuda kweNdzimu muna Khirisitu Yesu nekwenyu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Musitshambidzile Meya, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />musilingile pasi bulebesambeli, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />koga holesesani tjimwe netjimwe; mubhatilile muna tjakalulama, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />muthubukane nezwibi zose.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Kadzene Ndzimu wekunyalala iye tjekukwe angamuyengemadza ngekuhhele; kakale kadzene meya yenyu nenkumbulo wenyu nembili wenyu kungatjengetedzeka kuli kubuya kusingawanike nlandu pakubuya kwaHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Iye unomudana unogalikamoyo, kakale unowhokuthama.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Makamu, mutitembezelele bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Mulebelese makamu ose neputa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zila yelezwana kwebanhu beku Asiya</char></note> kwakayengemala.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ndomulaya muzina laHe kuti lukwalo igogu gubaligwe bagalimoyo bose.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Ngoni dzaHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu ngadzibe namwi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>